* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.glb binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
# Converted assets, converter caches and the editor's base overlay are stored byte for byte: the World Editor's base
# overlay and the deploy manifest compare SHA-256 hashes, so no line-ending normalisation may touch them.
work/** -text
# The deploy ships code with `git archive HEAD` and syncs work/out + work/out-opt separately (deploy/assets.ts):
# keep the committed assets out of the code archive.
/work export-ignore
